","name":"Developer Tools","description":"\u003cp\u003eHost code, build, test, and deploy your applications quickly and effectively with AWS developer tools. Leverage core tools like software development kits (SDKs), code editors, and continuous integration and delivery (CI/CD) services for DevOps software development. Use machine learning (ML) -guided best practices and abstractions to improve agility, security, velocity, and code quality.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-07-14T01:14:12+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-14T01:14:12+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#mawdoo3-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"mawdoo3-case-study","dateCreated":"2019-07-19T14:58:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2021-12-22T19:28:14+0000","additionalFields":{"featured":"0","descriptionSummary":"Mawdoo3\u0027s artificial intelligence (AI) initiatives run on AWS, giving site visitors new ways of accessing information and a faster experience. Its online encyclopedia, launched in 2012, is the world\u0027s largest Arabic-language content platform.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/Mawdoo3_Customer-Reference_Logo.0d5e0a1a7d8bad188bfdd188e6fdedf5793482a2.png","displayLocation":"Jordan","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eRead the Mawdoo3 customer case study, powered by the AWS Cloud. AWS provides cloud computing services to hundreds of thousands of customers around the globe.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Media \u0026 Entertainment","sortDate":"2018-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/mawdoo3/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Mawdoo3","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2018","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Mawdoo3 Case Study"}},"tags":[{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#startup","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Startup","description":"Startup","dateCreated":"20