ing 500 applications to the cloud as part of a major digital transformation. The GE Oil \u0026 Gas cloud migration project is helping the General Electric division achieve a 52 percent decrease in IT costs, greater speed to market, and the agility to compete even better in an industry experiencing immense market challenges.","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/GEPower_Customer-Reference_Logo.7100af15f7461bdc2ea9edec4f9b61e536c54f48.png","displayLocation":"Americas","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eRead the GE Oil \u0026amp; Gas customer case study, powered by the AWS cloud. AWS provides cloud computing services to hundreds of thousands of customers.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Manufacturing","sortDate":"2016-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/ge-oil-gas/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"GE Oil \u0026 Gas","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2016","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"GE Oil \u0026 Gas Case Study"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#kinesis","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Kinesis","description":"Amazon Kinesis","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:15+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:45+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#datacenter-migration","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Datacenter Migration","description":"Datacenter Migration","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-19T04:21:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#oil-gas","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Oil \u0026 Gas","description":"Oil \u0026 Gas","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:36+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:07+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise","description":"Enterprise","dateCreated":"201